  "question": {
    "text": "For a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the angle <math><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math>, then the locus of the centroid of the triangle is",
